<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav money supply rises in September vs August.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav money supply rises in September vs August.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Yugoslavia on Thursday reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>YUGOSLAV MONEY SUPPLY (in billions of dinars)</p>
<p>				   SEP 96	  AUG 96	 SEP 95</p>
<p> M1				 4.596	   4.485	  2.744</p>
<p> M2				 6.312	   6.258	  3.590</p>
<p> M3				29.610	  29.375	 10.467</p>
<p>-- Gordana Filipovic, Belgrade newsroom, +381 11 222 4254</p>
</text>
